# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, Windows clones run with core.autocrlf=true: the index holds LF
# while the working tree holds CRLF. Most of the time that's invisible, but
# lint-staged stashes unstaged work with `git diff` (LF) and restores it with
# `git apply` against a CRLF tree, which fails — "Failed to restore unstaged
# changes" — and rolls the whole commit back. It's also the source of the
# constant "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings.
#
# LF everywhere keeps the index and the working tree in agreement on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated — never diffed by hand, and huge.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
